-- prompt.md --
Implement `slugify(text)` in `textkit/slug.py`. It turns a title into a URL slug:

- lowercase the text;
- reduce accented Latin letters to their base letter (for example "é" becomes "e"), using the standard library's `unicodedata`;
- keep ASCII letters and digits; every run of any other characters becomes a single hyphen;
- no leading or trailing hyphen;
- if nothing is left, return the empty string.

Use only the standard library.
